    "HOMICIDE: top-10 slightly higher in 5/6 years (p=0.15-0.51) \u2014 none significant",
    "OVERDOSE: top-10 higher in all 6 years (up to +6.5/100k absolute; p=0.31-0.90) \u2014 the OD crisis is driven by the fentanyl supply wave, not SMHA-spend rank"
